# Ethereum Component

Manages connection pools for both beacon and execution layer Ethereum nodes with automatic health checking and failover.

## Key Integration Pattern
- Dual-layer node management: separate pools for beacon chain and execution layer nodes
- Health-based node selection with automatic failover using random selection from healthy nodes
- Concurrent node management with goroutine-per-node pattern

## Important Constraints
- Thread-safe operations required for all node pool access (use mutex protection)
- Metrics must be updated atomically to avoid race conditions in Prometheus registration